# The car for tomorrow: in the evening, a line when the car is low, and one
# tap to start charging when it is plugged in but not charging.
workflow car-tomorrow
subject house
about At <car at>: tells you when the car is under half and not plugged in, and asks with one tap to start charging when it is plugged in but not charging.
start owner, schedule:car-evening
tag no
limits steps 10, days 1

step status
tool car/car_status {}
retry 1 wait 10m

step read
answer json
tools none
do:
  The car's status, read just now, is in the data below. Answer only JSON:
  {"line": "...", "low": true or false, "plugged": true or false, "charging": true or false}
  "line": one short sentence with the battery (%), the range (km) and
  whether it is plugged in or charging, like "Car 34 %, 150 km, not plugged in."
  "low": true when the battery is under 50 %.
  The car's status: {status}
if read.low is false goto fine
if read.charging is true goto fine
if read.plugged is false goto plug

step ask
approve {read.line}
yes Start charging
no Leave it
timeout 2h
on deny goto fine

step charge
tool car/car_command {"command": "charge_start"}
on fail goto charge_failed
if charge starts done goto charging

step charge_unsure
say I asked the car to charge; it hasn't confirmed: {charge}
end

step charging
say Charging started.
end

step charge_failed
say The car didn't start charging: {charge.error}
end

step plug
say {read.line} Plug it in for tomorrow.
end

step fine
end
